{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20025","headline":"上张徐州 · 孟郊","name":"上张徐州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲水不入海，安得浮天波。\n爲木不在山，安得横日柯。\n再来君子傍，始觉精义多。\n大德唯一施，衆情自偏颇。\n至乐无宫徵，至声遗讴謌。\n愿鼓空桑弦，永使万物和。\n顾己诚拙讷，干名已蹉跎。\n献词惟在口，所欲无余佗。\n乍作支泉石，乍作翳松萝。\n一不改方圆，破质爲琢磨。\n贱子本如此，大贤心若何。\n岂是无异途，异途难经过。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20025.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20025","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}